WEBVTT

00:00:00.333 --> 00:00:02.250
I'm all fired up!

00:00:03.416 --> 00:00:04.833
Our main objective is...

00:00:04.833 --> 00:00:06.541
Dungeon Master!

00:00:07.791 --> 00:00:09.000
What was that?

00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:10.166
Oh, no!

00:00:10.166 --> 00:00:12.666
A horde of goblins is
charging out of the cave all of a sudden!

00:00:12.666 --> 00:00:14.000
They were quiet up until yesterday!

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:15.041
Are these goblins

00:00:15.041 --> 00:00:17.625
taking advantage of
the opportunity to attack us?

00:00:21.625 --> 00:00:24.625
The skill we acquired
from the Tyrant Saber Tiger.

00:00:24.625 --> 00:00:25.917
Fran?

00:00:27.457 --> 00:00:29.292
Sonic Wave!

00:00:32.417 --> 00:00:34.207
I'll defeat them all!

00:00:43.707 --> 00:00:45.332
That girl...

00:00:45.332 --> 00:00:48.417
Even after I told her
not to charge into the dungeon on her own.

00:00:48.417 --> 00:00:50.332
We should hurry.

00:00:50.332 --> 00:00:54.750
Or else she'll get all the loot.

00:00:54.750 --> 00:00:56.125
Fran,

00:00:56.125 --> 00:00:59.542
you mustn't overexert yourself
like you did last time.

00:00:59.542 --> 00:01:00.750
I know.

00:01:00.750 --> 00:01:03.332
I'll clear the dungeon without overdoing it.

00:01:03.332 --> 00:01:06.000
You make it sound so easy.

00:01:06.000 --> 00:01:07.792
Well, in any case, if the worst does happen,

00:01:07.792 --> 00:01:09.250
we can get out of here

00:01:09.250 --> 00:01:10.207
(Teleportation Feather)
we can get out of here

00:01:10.207 --> 00:01:12.917
(Can Be Used to Teleport Out of Dungeon Instantly)
using the Teleportation Feather
we bought with gold.

00:01:12.917 --> 00:01:15.457
I'll go as far as I can.

00:01:15.457 --> 00:01:16.875
All right!

00:01:19.042 --> 00:01:20.375
There they are.

00:01:20.375 --> 00:01:21.875
Parallel Thought!

00:01:22.707 --> 00:01:26.167
We'll take the crystals
from the goblins with useful skills.

00:01:26.167 --> 00:01:28.042
Take down the others

00:01:28.042 --> 00:01:30.875
or leave them for the others behind us.

00:01:30.875 --> 00:01:31.667
Got it?

00:01:32.582 --> 00:01:34.082
Roger.

00:01:34.082 --> 00:01:36.000
Take crystals from the two goblins ahead!

00:01:44.667 --> 00:01:47.332
Leaving bodies without crystals
will raise suspicion,

00:01:47.332 --> 00:01:49.375
so let's put them
in the Dimensional Storage for now.

00:01:50.625 --> 00:01:52.167
Leave the coming three

00:01:52.167 --> 00:01:53.667
for the others.

00:01:53.667 --> 00:01:54.792
Roger!

00:01:57.375 --> 00:01:59.250
Take the crystal from the next one!

00:02:03.125 --> 00:02:04.832
Ignore these...

00:02:04.832 --> 00:02:06.332
Take crystals from them...

00:02:07.125 --> 00:02:08.082
Fran,

00:02:08.082 --> 00:02:10.667
your skill of obtaining crystals has improved.

00:02:11.542 --> 00:02:14.082
I've gotten used to taking care of goblins.

00:02:14.082 --> 00:02:15.500
You're amazing!

00:02:15.500 --> 00:02:17.375
I was praised!

00:02:17.375 --> 00:02:18.625
Fran!

00:02:19.917 --> 00:02:20.875
Ignore this one!

00:02:20.875 --> 00:02:23.625
Crystal from this one! And this one!

00:02:23.625 --> 00:02:24.625
Ignore.

00:02:25.875 --> 00:02:27.292
Crystal!

00:02:32.250 --> 00:02:35.332
There's more than I thought.
They just keep coming.

00:02:36.667 --> 00:02:42.207
These are goblins without useful skills
that we ignored, huh...

00:02:42.207 --> 00:02:45.625
Let's use a Double Chant

00:02:45.776 --> 00:02:49.193
with Parallel Thought and Fire Javelin!

00:02:56.542 --> 00:02:59.750
Teacher's Parallel Thought is amazing!

00:03:00.875 --> 00:03:04.292
My Parallel Thought is steadily improving.

00:03:04.292 --> 00:03:09.332
I had Fran use this skill once...

00:03:09.332 --> 00:03:10.457
What's the matter, Fran?

00:03:10.457 --> 00:03:14.457
My head hurts! I don't like this skill!

00:03:15.332 --> 00:03:20.667
It appears only inorganic matter like me
is able to use the skill without adverse effects.

00:03:22.792 --> 00:03:25.167
Teacher, this path...

00:03:25.167 --> 00:03:27.667
There's another floor.

00:03:27.667 --> 00:03:29.875
This place runs deep indeed.

00:03:29.875 --> 00:03:32.042
So the boss is down there?

00:03:42.957 --> 00:03:49.417
(Reincarnated as a Sword)

00:05:08.589 --> 00:05:12.666
(Episode 5 A Perfect Dungeon Debut)

00:05:12.666 --> 00:05:14.958
Skill, Echolocation.

00:05:14.958 --> 00:05:19.875
Presence Sensor.
Vibration Detection. Heat Detection.

00:05:22.750 --> 00:05:25.083
Two Hobgoblins detected.

00:05:25.083 --> 00:05:26.583
Found them.

00:05:32.916 --> 00:05:35.125
Now, lead us

00:05:35.125 --> 00:05:37.625
to the King and Queen.

00:05:41.166 --> 00:05:42.791
Teacher,

00:05:42.791 --> 00:05:45.583
I hear a clattering noise up ahead.

00:05:45.583 --> 00:05:48.916
Are we finally going to face them?

00:05:48.916 --> 00:05:50.541
The Dungeon Master?

00:05:50.541 --> 00:05:52.000
I wonder.

00:05:54.625 --> 00:05:55.458
Watch out!

00:05:55.458 --> 00:05:56.375
Behind you!

00:06:00.125 --> 00:06:02.166
As expected of Mr. Donadrond.

00:06:02.166 --> 00:06:03.625
So strong...

00:06:05.208 --> 00:06:09.583
But the little girl took out most of them.

00:06:09.583 --> 00:06:13.791
Well, she did leave some for us.

00:06:13.791 --> 00:06:16.125
For a goblin stampede,

00:06:16.125 --> 00:06:19.333
I'm seeing fewer bodies than expected.

00:06:19.333 --> 00:06:21.083
Mr. Donadrond,

00:06:21.083 --> 00:06:23.458
just who is that little girl?

00:06:23.458 --> 00:06:24.541
Who knows?

00:06:24.541 --> 00:06:27.166
All I know is that she may look young,

00:06:27.166 --> 00:06:30.000
but her Sword Technique
and Sword Art are Level 7.

00:06:30.000 --> 00:06:32.166
That almost puts her
at the same level as an advanced expert.

00:06:32.166 --> 00:06:36.500
That explains why the Hobgoblins
were no match for her.

00:06:36.500 --> 00:06:38.750
Even so, she is still a child.

00:06:38.750 --> 00:06:41.708
She could get into trouble
if she lets her guard down.

00:06:41.708 --> 00:06:43.333
Let's hurry and catch up with her.

00:06:50.000 --> 00:06:51.458
Bingo.

00:06:58.333 --> 00:07:00.208
What a powerful aura.

00:07:00.208 --> 00:07:03.750
So that's the Goblin King and Queen...

00:07:03.750 --> 00:07:06.541
This happened in the Marou Plains too.

00:07:06.541 --> 00:07:09.083
When the goblins sense intruders,

00:07:09.083 --> 00:07:12.500
they gather around the king.

00:07:12.500 --> 00:07:14.125
Teacher, do we attack?

00:07:14.125 --> 00:07:16.583
No. There are too many of them.

00:07:16.583 --> 00:07:18.541
The king and queen are not easy opponents.

00:07:18.541 --> 00:07:20.750
We should proceed with caution.

00:07:20.750 --> 00:07:22.541
Got it.

00:07:22.541 --> 00:07:26.333
First, I'll throw magic onto them as a distraction.

00:07:26.333 --> 00:07:27.541
Okay.

00:07:27.541 --> 00:07:31.208
You'll seize the chance
to slay the king and queen.

00:07:31.208 --> 00:07:33.166
Mm. Got it.

00:07:35.166 --> 00:07:36.208
Let's do this.

00:07:36.208 --> 00:07:38.958
Parallel Thought. Double Chant.

00:07:38.958 --> 00:07:41.000
Flare Blast!

00:07:44.041 --> 00:07:45.708
Fire Javelin!

00:07:50.416 --> 00:07:52.125
Now's your chance! Attack!

00:07:55.291 --> 00:07:56.791
Huh?

00:08:00.041 --> 00:08:05.541
Are they... dead already?

00:08:06.541 --> 00:08:09.875
Um, Fran...

00:08:09.875 --> 00:08:11.625
Teacher, you meanie...

00:08:11.625 --> 00:08:15.125
I really wanted to fight the Goblin King...

00:08:15.125 --> 00:08:17.083
S... Sorry...

00:08:17.083 --> 00:08:19.083
You stole my job...

00:08:19.750 --> 00:08:21.125
Um...

00:08:21.125 --> 00:08:22.916
Oh, right. Where did the other goblins go?

00:08:22.916 --> 00:08:24.250
They fled.

00:08:24.250 --> 00:08:27.916
I guess this is what they call
"fleeing in all directions."

00:08:27.916 --> 00:08:31.625
Teacher,
does this mean we've completed the quest?

00:08:31.625 --> 00:08:33.000
I'm not sure.

00:08:33.000 --> 00:08:34.667
If that was the  Dungeon Master,

00:08:34.667 --> 00:08:36.957
there should be a
more distinct signal or something...

00:08:36.957 --> 00:08:40.750
A door... The dungeon goes even deeper.

00:08:40.750 --> 00:08:42.417
It would seem so.

00:08:42.417 --> 00:08:46.542
Maybe the Dungeon Master
was neither the king nor queen

00:08:46.542 --> 00:08:48.917
but someone else instead.

00:08:48.917 --> 00:08:50.667
Dungeon Master.

00:08:50.667 --> 00:08:52.292
I'll slay them!

00:08:52.292 --> 00:08:56.917
Dungeon Master...

00:08:56.917 --> 00:08:59.750
Well, at least she regained her spirit.

00:09:01.875 --> 00:09:04.875
I have a bad feeling about this.

00:09:04.875 --> 00:09:06.750
Don't let your guard down, Fran.

00:09:10.707 --> 00:09:11.917
What?

00:09:11.917 --> 00:09:13.082
I can see them...

00:09:14.167 --> 00:09:15.957
A whole bunch of bugs!

00:09:15.957 --> 00:09:17.792
Bugs?

00:09:23.792 --> 00:09:26.250
Those are some massive ladybugs!

00:09:26.250 --> 00:09:28.542
And a lot of them!

00:09:28.542 --> 00:09:29.957
Appraisal!

00:09:29.957 --> 00:09:32.250
(Army Beetles)
Army Beetles.

00:09:32.250 --> 00:09:34.292
(Lv. 2)
Their levels pose little concern though.

00:09:35.250 --> 00:09:37.000
Medic and Shooter.

00:09:37.000 --> 00:09:39.375
There're some of them with a class here and there.

00:09:39.375 --> 00:09:41.332
That means they carry lots of crystals!

00:09:41.332 --> 00:09:43.292
We'll get a great deal of that from them.

00:09:43.292 --> 00:09:45.000
I'll defeat all of them!

00:09:45.625 --> 00:09:47.457
All right then,

00:09:47.457 --> 00:09:49.082
let's get them, Fran!

00:09:50.125 --> 00:09:53.207
Given their size,
I can seal their movements with Telekinesis.

00:09:53.207 --> 00:09:55.207
Let's kill them all at once!

00:10:01.832 --> 00:10:03.625
Crystal absorb!

00:10:03.625 --> 00:10:06.250
This is like a bonus stage!

00:10:06.250 --> 00:10:08.292
(30 minutes later)

00:10:09.917 --> 00:10:11.667
We killed a lot...

00:10:11.667 --> 00:10:15.000
But it feels like we barely made a dent
in their numbers...

00:10:16.832 --> 00:10:18.917
Hang on. What's that?

00:10:18.917 --> 00:10:21.875
They're summoning reinforcements.

00:10:21.875 --> 00:10:23.707
I see. So that's the culprit.

00:10:23.707 --> 00:10:26.332
(Army Beetles Leader)
Army Beetles Leader.

00:10:26.332 --> 00:10:29.832
(Skill: Kin Summon 5)
Kin Summon...

00:10:29.832 --> 00:10:30.917
How about it, Fran?

00:10:30.917 --> 00:10:32.792
Are you satisfied?

00:10:32.792 --> 00:10:33.457
Yes.

00:10:33.457 --> 00:10:36.625
Okay! So much for the bonus stage!

00:10:37.292 --> 00:10:39.707
Tri-Explosion!

00:10:43.000 --> 00:10:46.082
The leader is mine!

00:10:48.082 --> 00:10:50.000
Crystal absorb!

00:10:50.000 --> 00:10:52.292
Did we gain a lot from that?

00:10:52.292 --> 00:10:53.667
We got a bunch of crystal exp,

00:10:53.667 --> 00:10:56.207
and you've leveled up a lot too.

00:10:56.957 --> 00:11:01.000
Fran has leveled to Level 17.

00:11:01.000 --> 00:11:02.125
That's great!

00:11:02.125 --> 00:11:04.167
We also acquired new skills.

00:11:04.167 --> 00:11:06.957
Kin Summon acquired.

00:11:06.957 --> 00:11:10.457
Wind Magic increased to Level 7.

00:11:10.457 --> 00:11:13.417
Teacher, there's another door.

00:11:13.417 --> 00:11:15.457
There's more to this place?

00:11:17.292 --> 00:11:18.625
Did you feel that?

00:11:19.375 --> 00:11:20.792
A strong presence of mana!

00:11:20.792 --> 00:11:24.667
It feels more powerful
than the boss of the Marou Plains,

00:11:24.667 --> 00:11:28.667
the C-rank monster, Glutton Slime King.

00:11:28.667 --> 00:11:31.292
As long as I'm with Teacher, we can do this.

00:11:31.292 --> 00:11:32.207
Yes.

00:11:32.207 --> 00:11:37.332
But we can be certain that what lies
behind this door is a formidable being.

00:11:37.332 --> 00:11:40.375
Let's cast some buffs to prepare ourselves.

00:11:41.457 --> 00:11:44.250
First, All Resistance.

00:11:44.250 --> 00:11:49.332
Fran's resistance against abnormal statuses
has been temporarily increased.

00:11:50.292 --> 00:11:55.375
Next, Sensory Boost, to sharpen your senses
and enhances your reflexes.

00:11:55.375 --> 00:11:58.375
Physical Boost
to enhance your physical strength.

00:11:58.375 --> 00:12:00.667
My body feels lighter.

00:12:00.667 --> 00:12:02.417
Next, Regeneration.

00:12:02.417 --> 00:12:06.500
Fran's wounds will automatically recover
over a certain period.

00:12:06.500 --> 00:12:08.792
Teacher, do you have enough mana?

00:12:08.792 --> 00:12:12.875
I absorbed a ton from the Army Beetles,
so I'm brimming with mana right now.

00:12:13.875 --> 00:12:14.750
Fran,

00:12:14.750 --> 00:12:19.542
if you make it back in one piece,
I'll make you my best dish!

00:12:19.542 --> 00:12:21.417
Your best dish?

00:12:21.417 --> 00:12:22.750
Yes.

00:12:22.750 --> 00:12:25.250
It's called "curry".

00:12:25.250 --> 00:12:27.667
C... Curry!

00:12:27.667 --> 00:12:29.667
What's that? I've never heard of it.

00:12:29.667 --> 00:12:35.082
But it sounds like a fancy dish.
I want to eat it so badly!

00:12:35.082 --> 00:12:38.082
Well then, you must survive.

00:12:40.000 --> 00:12:42.082
I won't die.

00:12:55.500 --> 00:12:59.875
Welcome to the deepest part of the dungeon.

00:13:03.957 --> 00:13:06.375
(Reincarnated as a Sword)

00:13:06.375 --> 00:13:08.042
Mr. Klimt.

00:13:08.042 --> 00:13:10.250
Nell, what is it?

00:13:10.250 --> 00:13:14.042
Will Mr. Donadrond and Fran really be able

00:13:14.042 --> 00:13:16.000
to clear the dungeon?

00:13:16.000 --> 00:13:18.792
It's a newly spawned dungeon.

00:13:18.792 --> 00:13:22.667
It hasn't been occupied by particularly
powerful monsters yet. I'm sure they'll be fine.

00:13:22.667 --> 00:13:24.582
You're right.

00:13:24.582 --> 00:13:27.957
So long as there are
no unforeseen circumstances.

00:13:29.875 --> 00:13:31.332
Fran...

00:13:34.125 --> 00:13:36.042
Darn it! The door won't open!

00:13:37.250 --> 00:13:38.875
Are you all right, Fran?

00:13:38.875 --> 00:13:40.207
Answer me!

00:13:40.207 --> 00:13:44.250
She seems to have taken care
of the king and queen.

00:13:44.250 --> 00:13:47.000
Then behind this door is...

00:13:47.000 --> 00:13:49.625
I'm afraid so.

00:13:50.417 --> 00:13:53.917
That powerful presence of mana
came from this guy.

00:13:53.917 --> 00:13:56.750
But who the heck is this guy?

00:13:56.750 --> 00:13:58.957
Is he the Dungeon Master?

00:13:59.917 --> 00:14:02.082
In any case, let's use Appraisal.

00:14:02.082 --> 00:14:05.582
(Greater Demon, Lv. 30)
What? A Greater Demon?

00:14:05.582 --> 00:14:07.542
What the heck is with those stats?

00:14:07.542 --> 00:14:09.500
He is beyond strong!

00:14:09.500 --> 00:14:12.457
It's my first time encountering a monster
with stats over 1000!

00:14:12.457 --> 00:14:14.832
Extra skills and Dark Magic...

00:14:14.832 --> 00:14:18.875
(Extra Skill: Skill Taker 6)
All of them are skills we don't even know...

00:14:18.875 --> 00:14:20.750
According to Randell,

00:14:20.750 --> 00:14:23.207
Greater Demons have a threat level of B.

00:14:23.207 --> 00:14:24.207
(Title: Demon Count,
Equipment: Shadow Demonite Steel Longsword)
B...

00:14:24.207 --> 00:14:24.957
(A special monster that can only be summoned
by a dungeon master.)

00:14:24.957 --> 00:14:28.250
(Kin of the God of Chaos, Extremely Powerful"
A monster capable of
destroying an entire nation.

00:14:29.375 --> 00:14:31.207
Now, now,

00:14:31.207 --> 00:14:34.042
don't tell me you're afraid.

00:14:34.042 --> 00:14:36.125
I'm not.

00:14:36.125 --> 00:14:38.332
You look weak.

00:14:38.332 --> 00:14:40.832
But that doesn't mean I'll go easy on you.

00:14:40.832 --> 00:14:44.707
You must have considerable skills
to be able to reach this far.

00:14:44.707 --> 00:14:46.332
I'm strong.

00:14:47.750 --> 00:14:49.292
You're a bold one.

00:14:49.292 --> 00:14:50.707
Hey, demon!

00:14:50.707 --> 00:14:54.250
What are you waiting for?
Hurry up and get rid of her!

00:14:54.250 --> 00:14:56.167
Huh?

00:14:56.167 --> 00:14:57.750
That's...

00:14:57.750 --> 00:15:01.000
(Rare Goblin, LV: 11)
Huh? So that's the Dungeon Master?

00:15:01.000 --> 00:15:04.667
No way, his stats are super low!

00:15:04.667 --> 00:15:07.042
So that's the dungeon core?

00:15:07.042 --> 00:15:08.707
I suppose so.

00:15:08.707 --> 00:15:10.667
Hurry up and kill her already!

00:15:10.667 --> 00:15:12.917
Quit nagging. You're annoying.

00:15:12.917 --> 00:15:16.917
I'll take care of her, so shut up and watch.

00:15:18.375 --> 00:15:20.582
A goblin that can talk.

00:15:20.582 --> 00:15:22.417
I understand goblins and beetles,

00:15:22.417 --> 00:15:26.625
but can that guy really command
a B-rank monster?

00:15:26.625 --> 00:15:28.125
Hey, brat!

00:15:28.125 --> 00:15:30.292
You puny human!

00:15:30.292 --> 00:15:34.500
How dare you kill the elites
of our goblin empire!

00:15:34.500 --> 00:15:36.667
Yep, I took care of them.

00:15:36.667 --> 00:15:41.332
It's all because of you that I now have
to remake my plan to conquer the human world!

00:15:41.332 --> 00:15:42.707
Oi.

00:15:42.707 --> 00:15:46.750
No matter. All I have to do
is kill you and summon another king.

00:15:46.750 --> 00:15:49.582
As long as I can replenish
the Goddess Points of the dungeon core,

00:15:49.582 --> 00:15:51.207
I can summon as many monsters as I want...

00:15:52.542 --> 00:15:54.832
Shut up, you useless master!

00:15:54.832 --> 00:15:56.667
Or I'll kill you!

00:15:58.042 --> 00:16:00.582
How come this demon never obeys me?

00:16:00.582 --> 00:16:03.332
Your orders are useless against me.

00:16:03.332 --> 00:16:06.167
I'll fight as I wish.

00:16:06.167 --> 00:16:08.250
A skill that renders control null.

00:16:08.250 --> 00:16:11.417
Now then, let's get started.

00:16:11.417 --> 00:16:13.957
That sword is dangerous.

00:16:13.957 --> 00:16:18.250
Teacher channeled 500 MP into ATK.

00:16:22.207 --> 00:16:24.417
Nice sword.

00:16:24.417 --> 00:16:27.000
Oh, it's able to withstand my sword.

00:16:28.207 --> 00:16:30.500
There's no way he would lose to that sword!

00:16:30.500 --> 00:16:32.457
No, that sword...

00:16:32.457 --> 00:16:34.957
It has very high mana conductivity.

00:16:34.957 --> 00:16:38.750
(Mana Conductivity: C+, ATK: 561+450)
With the additional MP, its ATK is over 1000.

00:16:38.750 --> 00:16:42.292
I was only able to withstand that hit
because of my 500 MP...

00:16:42.292 --> 00:16:45.042
If not, I would have snapped just now.

00:16:55.542 --> 00:16:57.792
Not bad blocking that hit.

00:16:57.792 --> 00:16:59.542
Aura Blade!

00:17:03.667 --> 00:17:04.666
Now!

00:17:05.583 --> 00:17:07.000
Wait, Fran!

00:17:12.291 --> 00:17:15.250
That sword's skill is Shadow Back.

00:17:15.250 --> 00:17:16.291
That bastard...

00:17:16.291 --> 00:17:19.333
He intentionally left himself open
to lure you into attacking him.

00:17:19.333 --> 00:17:23.375
You seem to have a higher mastery
of sword skills than I do.

00:17:24.666 --> 00:17:25.791
Then...

00:17:25.791 --> 00:17:27.458
How about this?

00:17:28.541 --> 00:17:29.875
He vanished...

00:17:34.500 --> 00:17:36.041
What?

00:17:36.041 --> 00:17:37.666
Fran!

00:17:42.916 --> 00:17:43.875
Die!

00:17:43.875 --> 00:17:45.250
Parallel Thought!

00:17:45.875 --> 00:17:47.166
Fran!

00:17:47.166 --> 00:17:48.333
Damn it!

00:17:48.333 --> 00:17:50.291
Fire Wall!

00:17:54.916 --> 00:17:57.875
Telekinesis! Greater Heal!

00:18:00.875 --> 00:18:04.375
You can even use
that advanced recovery magic, huh?

00:18:04.375 --> 00:18:06.791
Interesting.

00:18:06.791 --> 00:18:08.250
Teacher...

00:18:08.250 --> 00:18:10.916
It's all right, Fran. Don't worry.

00:18:10.916 --> 00:18:12.416
I recovered them right away.

00:18:12.416 --> 00:18:14.375
Can you feel them again?

00:18:14.375 --> 00:18:15.666
A little.

00:18:15.666 --> 00:18:17.958
It stings a little, but I'm fine.

00:18:19.500 --> 00:18:21.333
I'm sorry. I was too careless.

00:18:21.333 --> 00:18:24.291
No. That wasn't due to your carelessness.

00:18:24.291 --> 00:18:26.750
He appeared from your blind spot.

00:18:26.750 --> 00:18:28.833
Is that some sort of skill?

00:18:28.833 --> 00:18:30.666
I don't fully understand what's going on,

00:18:30.666 --> 00:18:34.208
but you're pretty good to be able
to defend yourself from there.

00:18:34.208 --> 00:18:36.041
Fran, behind you!

00:18:37.875 --> 00:18:40.000
I'm going to keep coming at you.

00:18:44.250 --> 00:18:46.000
So quick to respond?

00:18:46.000 --> 00:18:48.208
This is more like it!

00:18:50.791 --> 00:18:52.458
To all appearances, he simply disappeared.

00:18:52.458 --> 00:18:54.583
Is it Teleportation?

00:18:54.583 --> 00:18:57.666
But he didn't possess a skill
like that when I checked.

00:18:57.666 --> 00:18:59.500
Is it magic, then?

00:18:59.500 --> 00:19:02.333
Shade Magic or Dark Magic?

00:19:06.208 --> 00:19:10.791
The mana isn't coming from the air
but from the ground.

00:19:10.791 --> 00:19:14.666
Dark... Shade... Ground...

00:19:14.666 --> 00:19:15.666
I've got it!

00:19:15.666 --> 00:19:18.125
Fran, it's the shadow!

00:19:18.125 --> 00:19:20.583
That guy is coming from your shadow!

00:19:22.750 --> 00:19:24.333
You can target him from here, right?

00:19:26.416 --> 00:19:29.666
Vibration Fang and Demonic Poisonous Fang!

00:19:29.666 --> 00:19:31.958
Sonic Wave!

00:19:34.416 --> 00:19:36.625
Take that! Now...

00:19:36.625 --> 00:19:38.583
Dark Magic...

00:19:38.583 --> 00:19:41.333
Darkness Blaster!

00:19:51.916 --> 00:19:53.208
Poison?

00:19:53.208 --> 00:19:57.791
You managed to break through
my abnormal status resistance and poison me?

00:19:58.958 --> 00:20:02.541
But it's too weak.

00:20:02.541 --> 00:20:03.958
It didn't work!

00:20:03.958 --> 00:20:07.750
Even Demonic Poisonous Fang,
an enhanced version of the Poisonous Fang

00:20:07.750 --> 00:20:10.708
we acquired from the Doppel Snake,
didn't do anything to him!

00:20:10.708 --> 00:20:12.750
Is that all you've got?

00:20:14.291 --> 00:20:17.916
The classic skill combo we used to take down
strong opponents is ineffective against him!

00:20:17.916 --> 00:20:20.458
Teacher, what do we do?

00:20:20.458 --> 00:20:23.583
To be completely honest,
things are not looking good for us right now.

00:20:23.583 --> 00:20:28.791
Let's use the Teleportation Feather
to get out of here

00:20:28.791 --> 00:20:31.333
while he is underestimating us.

00:20:31.333 --> 00:20:33.708
But I have to win!

00:20:33.708 --> 00:20:35.416
I have to win...

00:20:41.375 --> 00:20:44.166
And taste that curry!

00:20:55.666 --> 00:20:57.625
You've got spirit, all right.

00:20:57.625 --> 00:21:00.416
But that's far from enough.

00:21:00.416 --> 00:21:03.583
This amount of damage
barely makes me feel anything.

00:21:03.583 --> 00:21:06.500
Come on. Put more force into it!

00:21:11.583 --> 00:21:17.208
Your speed and sword skills
are better than mine.

00:21:17.208 --> 00:21:19.375
I acknowledge that.

00:21:20.375 --> 00:21:25.000
In this case,
I'll take away those sword skills of yours.

00:21:25.958 --> 00:21:27.541
Be careful, Fran!

00:21:27.541 --> 00:21:29.000
Something is coming!

00:21:34.958 --> 00:21:37.375
I can sense some mana...

00:21:37.375 --> 00:21:39.083
What was that just now?

00:21:39.083 --> 00:21:41.625
I have no idea what just happened!

00:21:42.625 --> 00:21:45.708
Extra skill. Skill Taker.

00:21:45.708 --> 00:21:49.208
A skill that allows me
to take and claim desired skills for my own.

00:21:50.166 --> 00:21:54.375
I've taken your sword skills.

00:21:54.375 --> 00:21:58.416
That means you've lost
the ability to fight against me.

00:21:58.416 --> 00:22:00.833
All that awaits you is death.

00:23:34.250 --> 00:23:40.041
(Next Episode The Greater Demon Was a Cheater)
